# The engines this build ships with.
#
# Registration lives beside the implementation rather than in one central list,
# because that is the whole point: an engine module carries its own line here, and
# adding one is adding a module. When :engine-postgres and :engine-redis are carved
# out of :core, this file splits into two files that each name one engine, and
# nothing that reads it changes.
dev.caracal.engine.postgres.PostgresEngine
dev.caracal.engine.redis.RedisEngine
